          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><em>Our artisans approach every bottle as a true work of art. Each note is chosen with the utmost precision blending nature’s finest elements with an unwavering dedication to excellence.<br/>With every creation, we fuse heritage and innovation, crafting not just a scent, but a sensory journey a tribute to refinement, depth, and timeless artistry.<br/></em></p>"
