        },
        "richtext_tybgCm": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><em>But what truly sets us apart is the meticulous care behind every bottle. It takes over 7 hours to craft each one, ensuring that no two are ever alike. From the sourcing of the world’s rarest raw materials to the artisanal bottling process, each creation is a one-of-a-kind masterpiece, shaped by precision, passion, and reverence for detail.<br/><br/>This legacy of uniqueness continues to define our house today. We invite you to discover our extraordinary fragrances, where every note reflects over four decades of craftsmanship, and each scent unveils a story of heritage and artistry.<br/></em></p>"
